:[],"verdict":{"label":"no_detectable_change","certainty":"too_soon","answer":{"simple":"Too soon to tell if the land is changing in Sahara near Tamanrasset, Algeria.","scientific":"No significant trend in Evapotranspiration (GLDAS Noah), Sahara near Tamanrasset, Algeria (point 22.79, 5.52) (2000–2025).","simple_es":"Aún no sabemos si la tierra está cambiando cuánta agua suelta en Sahara cerca de Tamanrasset, Argelia.","scientific_es":"Sin tendencia significativa en Evapotranspiración (GLDAS Noah), Sahara cerca de Tamanrasset, Argelia (punto 22,79; 5,52) (2000–2025)."},"how_much":{"simple":"We need to watch for about 127 more years.","scientific":"Sen's slope -0.002 mm/day per decade (95% CI -0.015 to +0.008), 2000-01 to 2025-12. Years to detection ≈ 152 vs 26 available (Weatherhead et al. 1998).","simple_es":"Necesitamos mirar unos 127 años más.","scientific_es":"Pendiente de Sen -0.002 mm/day por década (IC 95 % -0.015 a +0.008), 2000-01 a 2025-12. Años hasta la detección ≈ 152 frente a 26 disponibles (Weatherhead et al. 1998)."},"headline":{"simple":"Too soon to tell","scientific":"No detectable trend","simple_es":"Es muy pronto para saberlo","scientific_es":"Sin tendencia detectable"},"sentence":{"simple":"Normal ups and downs are bigger than any change so far. That does not mean nothing is changing.","scientific":"Evapotranspiration (GLDAS Noah), Sahara near Tamanrasset, Algeria (point 22.79, 5.52), 2000-01 to 2025-12: Sen's slope -0.002 mm/day per decade (95% CI -0.015 to +0.008), 2000-01 to 2025-12. Mann–Kendall (Hamed–Rao) p = 0.610; OLS with n_eff = 179 (r₁ = 0.27) p = 0.988. Not significant at α = 0.05; record short relative to detection time. Absence of evidence is not evidence of no trend.","simple_es":"Los altibajos normales son mayores que cualquier cambio hasta ahora. Eso no quiere decir que nada cambie.","scientific_es":"Evapotranspiración (GLDAS Noah), Sahara cerca de Tamanrasset, Argelia (punto 22,79; 5,52), 2000-01 a 2025-12: Pendiente de Sen -0.002 mm/day por década (IC 95 % -0.015 a +0.008), 2000-01 a 2025-12. Mann–Kendall con corrección de Hamed–Rao p = 0.610; MCO con n_eff = 179 (r₁ = 0.27) p = 0.988. No significativo con α = 0.05; registro corto respecto del tiempo de detección. La ausencia de evidencia no es evidencia de ausencia de tendencia."},"notes":[{"simple":"This is a computer model estimate, not a direct measurement.","scientific":"Model/reanalysis output; agreement with other products is not independent evidence.","simple_es":"Esta es una estimación de un modelo de computadora, no una medición directa.","scientific_es":"Salida de modelo/reanálisis; la coincidencia con otros productos no es evidencia independiente."}]}}
